<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Link/F 4/Border[0 0 0]/Rect[541.2217 369.5184 1370.7217 394.2684]/A 1381 0 R/StructParent 69/Contents(The Arab Climate Action Platform is a regional digital platform designed to empower and connect Arab youth-led climate initiatives. It addresses critical gaps identified across the region\204particularly the lack of visibility, institutional support, and cross-border collaboration\204by offering an inclusive space that documents impactful projects, facilitates partnerships,)>>
