141 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Link/F 4/Border[0 0 0]/Rect[541.2217 270.51844 1370.7217 295.26844]/A 1381 0 R/StructParent 73/Contents(and builds capacity within youth and civil society organizations. The platform not only amplifies youth voices at the regional and global levels but also contributes to policy dialogue and sustainable development goals by enhancing knowledge exchange and strategic engagement with government bodies, international institutions, and academia. As a catalyst for environmental innovation and collective climate action, the platform aspires to build a unified Arab youth climate movement leading meaningful change toward climate resilience and environmental justice.  )>>
endobj

