<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 312 0 R/T(The Wavemakers Summer Students Camp, held in collaboration with Wavemakers United, was designed to empower youth aged 14\20518. The program brought together 35 students from across the region and began with a 3-day virtual boot camp covering key topics such as climate change, water sustainability, and renewable energy.)/E(The Wavemakers Summer Students Camp, held in collaboration with Wavemakers United, was designed to empower youth aged 14\20518. The program brought together 35 students from across the region and began with a 3-day virtual boot camp covering key topics such as climate change, water sustainability, and renewable energy.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[7]>>
