686 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(This was followed by a 7-day on-site training camp in Hurghada, Egypt, where students participated in interactive workshops, marine activities, and mentorship sessions. The camp offered in-depth learning on water sustainability, the global water crisis, agriculture, energy, and climate change. Participants also explored the role of youth in addressing environmental challenges and gained insight into the history of COP negotiations and global climate policy.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[8]>>
