<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 314 0 R/T(Climatify partnered with the Nawah Network in a strategic initiative to empower rural women in marginalized communities across Egypt to face the challenges of climate change. The program directly empowered over 50 women and reached more than 200 participants in Assiut, Cairo, Alexandria, Beni Suef, and Beheira, through specialized training sessions, storytelling workshops with women farmers and fishers, and a nationwide awareness campaign.)/E(Climatify partnered with the Nawah Network in a strategic initiative to empower rural women in marginalized communities across Egypt to face the challenges of climate change. The program directly empowered over 50 women and reached more than 200 participants in Assiut, Cairo, Alexandria, Beni Suef, and Beheira, through specialized training sessions, storytelling workshops with women farmers and fishers, and a nationwide awareness campaign.)/Pg 30 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

715 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 314 0 R/E(The initiative engaged women leaders, civil society actors, and environmental advocates working in agriculture and coastal sectors. Key outcomes included gender-responsive policy recommendations, the creation of a women-led communication network across governorates, and community-driven solutions to climate challenges.)/Pg 30 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

