<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 314 0 R/E(As part of its long-term impact, the stories shared during the workshops will be documented and produced as a narrative podcast series to amplify rural women\220s voices and strengthen their presence in climate discourse.)/Pg 30 0 R/K[5]>>
