760 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 317 0 R/T(The Green Echo HACKATHON addresses the critical challenge of food security in vulnerable communities across the Middle East and North Africa \(MENA\), particularly those affected by environmental and climate change. The competition harnesses the creativity and innovation of young entrepreneurs to develop sustainable solutions for these pressing issues. In collaboration with international partners, we organized the hackathon, which attracted 160 project submissions from across the MENA region. After thorough evaluation, 42 projects advanced to the first stage, followed by 15 semi-finalists. Ultimately, 3 projects were selected as finalists, with the top winner announced in Amman, Jordan. This hackathon was organized alongside the RCOY MENA 2024 conference. )/E(The Green Echo HACKATHON addresses the critical challenge of food security in vulnerable communities across the Middle East and North Africa \(MENA\), particularly those affected by environmental and climate change. The competition harnesses the creativity and innovation of young entrepreneurs to develop sustainable solutions for these pressing issues. In collaboration with international partners, we organized the hackathon, which attracted 160 project submissions from across the MENA region. After thorough evaluation, 42 projects advanced to the first stage, followed by 15 semi-finalists. Ultimately, 3 projects were selected as finalists, with the top winner announced in Amman, Jordan. This hackathon was organized alongside the RCOY MENA 2024 conference. )/Pg 33 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

