<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 320 0 R/T(Agriclash is an interactive educational game developed by Climatify as one of the key outcomes of the SHIFT Program, aiming to promote awareness of sustainable agriculture, food security, and climate-smart farming practices. The game is designed to bridge the gap between environmental policies and farmers\220 real challenges through a dynamic learning experience.)/E(Agriclash is an interactive educational game developed by Climatify as one of the key outcomes of the SHIFT Program, aiming to promote awareness of sustainable agriculture, food security, and climate-smart farming practices. The game is designed to bridge the gap between environmental policies and farmers\220 real challenges through a dynamic learning experience.)/Pg 36 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

817 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 320 0 R/E(Players are divided into two teams\204Policy Makers and Engineers\204who collaborate and compete to manage agricultural resources, address climate-related challenges, and implement innovative AgriTech solutions. Through simulation, storytelling, and gamification, participants engage in real-life scenarios related to water management, crop productivity, and sustainable development.)/Pg 36 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

818 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 320 0 R/E(The game enhances strategic thinking, teamwork, and decision-making skills while introducing learners to modern agricultural technologies and policy frameworks. Agriclash transforms complex environmental and agricultural concepts into an accessible, engaging, and practical learning tool, reflecting the impact of the SHIFT Program in fostering youth-led innovation and experiential learning.)/Pg 36 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

