<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 337 0 R/E(Climatify had the honor of representing the UAE at the International Leadership Conference organized by the Islamic Cooperation Youth Forum \(ICYF\) in Azerbaijan, as part of the "Shusha - OIC Youth Capital 2024" program. The conference provided a valuable platform to engage with global leaders and discuss key issues related to youth leadership, diplomacy, and sustainable development. Climatify participated in panels highlighting the role of young leaders in shaping international relations and showcased the UAE's advancements in youth empowerment, innovation, and sustainability, aligning with the nation's Vision 2021 and the UN's Sustainable Development Goals \(SDGs\).)/Pg 53 0 R/K[9]>>
