1721 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 302 0 R/E(The Arab Climate Action Platform is a regional digital platform designed to empower and connect Arab youth-led climate initiatives. It addresses critical gaps identified across the region\204particularly the lack of visibility, institutional support, and cross-border collaboration\204by offering an inclusive space that documents impactful projects, facilitates partnerships,)/Pg 18 0 R/K[1253 0 R]>>
endobj

1722 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 302 0 R/E(and builds capacity within youth and civil society organizations. The platform not only amplifies youth voices at the regional and global levels but also contributes to policy dialogue and sustainable development goals by enhancing knowledge exchange and strategic engagement with government bodies, international institutions, and academia. As a catalyst for environmental innovation and collective climate action, the platform aspires to build a unified Arab youth climate movement leading meaningful change toward climate resilience and environmental justice.   Project Concept Note)/Pg 18 0 R/K[1254 0 R]>>
endobj

