<</Title(Climatify partnered with the Nawah Network in a strategic initiative to empower rural women in marginalized communities across Egypt to face the challenges of climate change. The program directly empowered over 50 women and reached more than 200 participants in Assiut, Cairo, Alexandria, Beni Suef, and Beheira, through specialized training sessions, storytelling workshops with women farmers and fishers, and a nationwide awareness campaign.)/Dest[30 0 R/Fit]/Parent 3140 0 R/Next 3171 0 R>>
