<</Title(We conducted the 'Little Green Heroes: Waste Management Fun' workshop at the Future Heroes Summer Camp, hosted by the Museum of the Future. The workshop focused on educating children about waste segregation, the 3Rs \(Reduce, Reuse, Recycle\), e-waste handling, and waste-to-energy processes. With participation from over 50 students, the workshop engaged them in interactive activities to raise awareness about effective waste management practices and the significance of sustainability. Through this initiative, we aimed to inspire the next generation to become environmental stewards.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 3155 0 R>>
endobj

